#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/label_display.rst:4
msgid "标签显示"
msgstr "Label display"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/label_display.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/label_display.rst:9
msgid "标签显示节点用于在图像中检测到的对象附近绘制文本标签，显示类别名称、置信度等信息。"
msgstr ""
"The label display node is used to draw text labels near detected objects in "
"the image, displaying information such as category names, confidence levels,"
" etc."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/label_display.rst:11
msgid ""
"该节点支持多种颜色方案、文本样式和位置配置，可以清晰地标注检测结果，是最常用的可视化节点之一。标签会自动定位在检测框的附近，提供清晰的目标识别信息。"
msgstr ""
"This node supports multiple color schemes, text styles and position "
"configurations, and can clearly label detection results. It is one of the "
"most commonly used visualization nodes.The label is automatically positioned"
" near the detection frame, providing clear target identification "
"information."

