#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/label_display.rst:119
msgid "分别对应红色、绿色、蓝色、黄色、紫色，颜色会按顺序分配给不同类别的标签背景。"
msgstr ""
"Corresponding to red, green, blue, yellow, and purple respectively, the "
"colors will be assigned to different categories of label backgrounds in "
"order."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/label_display.rst:123
